# ==========================================================
# NOT ON THE DEPLOY BRANCH
#
# This repo IS the deployment: GitHub Pages serves master's root
# directly, so anything committed here is a public URL. The files
# below are internal build/strategy material that was being served
# and indexed — docs/pricing.md carries price-floor and margin
# notes, Insparation/ is competitor screenshots, CLAUDE.md is the
# internal brief. They stay on disk for local work; they just
# don't ship.
#
# Removed from tracking with `git rm --cached` (files kept on disk).
# Earlier commits still contain them, so nothing is lost — but from
# now on changes to these files are NOT version-controlled. If that
# becomes a problem the fix is a separate private repo or an Actions
# build that publishes a subdirectory, not re-adding them here.
#
# Deliberately still tracked: serve.mjs and screenshot.mjs (no
# secrets, and the deploy-verification worktree needs serve.mjs),
# .nojekyll, brand_assets/00_Upload_Ready/ (favicons, OG image and
# logos referenced by every page head) and brand/laara-brand-tokens.css
# (a live stylesheet — only the .json twin is internal).
# ==========================================================
CLAUDE.md
docs/
Insparation/
brand/laara-brand-tokens.json

# Dev-only scripts. generate-image.mjs reads the OpenAI key from .env.
_qa_sweep.mjs
_verify_heroes.mjs
_verify_nav_dropdown.mjs
_verify_work_scrub.mjs
generate-image.mjs

# Node manifests — nothing on a static Pages deploy consumes these,
# and they advertise the toolchain and its versions.
package.json
package-lock.json
